{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "configNamespaceNotice", "en": "{0}'s settings panel cannot read its config: it asks for \"{1}\", and no entry id in this environment has that name. Its own entry is \"{2}\", which is what the plugin's client should ask for — the mistake is in the plugin, and the market cannot change it.", "ru": null, "zh": "{0} 的设置面板读不到配置：它按「{1}」读取，而这个环境里没有这个名字的条目 id。它自己的条目是「{2}」，插件客户端应该改成读那个——这是插件自身的问题，市场无法代改。", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "brokenPluginTitle", "en": "{0} was removed after a failed update", "ru": null, "zh": "{0} 更新失败后被移除了", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "brokenPluginBody", "en": "The running DSH blocked the update, and the version it was replacing was already damaged. The market removed it from the profile so the next start does not fail. Its directory is untouched — quit DSH and install it again.", "ru": null, "zh": "DSH 正在运行时无法更新，而更新前的版本也已经损坏。为避免下次启动卡住，市场把它从 profile 里移除。插件目录还在原处，退出 DSH 后重新安装即可。", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "brokenPluginTitleCancelled", "en": "{0} was removed after an update was cancelled", "ru": null, "zh": "{0} 取消更新后被移除了", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "brokenPluginBodyCancelled", "en": "The update was cancelled after the old version had been partly cleared. The market removed it from the profile so the next start does not fail. Its directory is untouched — install it again; if that fails, quit DSH first.", "ru": null, "zh": "取消时，旧版本已被清掉一部分。为避免下次启动卡住，市场把它从 profile 里移除。插件目录还在原处，重新安装即可；若再次失败，先退出 DSH 再装。", "source": "dshmarket"}
