{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "checkConfigNamespacesHint", "en": "A plugin panel reads its own config by ENTRY ID. A wrong name there reports nothing: the panel is blank and cannot save, and the plugin falls back to whatever default it hardcoded (a canvas panel shows a white screen). The name is wrong inside the plugin's own client bundle — the market cannot fix it, its author has to change one line.", "ru": null, "zh": "插件面板按「条目 id」读自己的配置，写错名字不会报错，只会静默读不到值：面板空白、存不进去，插件会退回它写死的默认值（画布类插件因此白屏）。这是插件客户端里的名字写错了，市场改不了它，需要插件作者改一行代码。", "source": "dshmarket"}
