{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "diagExplainText", "en": "This page checks for plugin conflicts, mismatched dependencies and wrong load order. Terms used:", "ru": null, "zh": "本页检查插件冲突、依赖版本不匹配与加载顺序问题。常用术语：", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "diagTermBundle", "en": "bundle = one plugin package, applied in order", "ru": null, "zh": "bundle = 一个插件包，会按顺序叠加加载", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "diagTermEntry", "en": "entry = one item a plugin registers in the running composition", "ru": null, "zh": "加载条目 = 插件在运行组合里注册的每一项", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "diagTermPeer", "en": "peer dependency = another package a plugin requires from the host", "ru": null, "zh": "对等依赖 = 插件要求宿主环境提供的另一个包", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "diagTermShadow", "en": "shadowing = a plugin’s old copy covers the host’s newer one", "ru": null, "zh": "遮蔽 = 插件自带的旧版包盖住了宿主的新版", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "diagTermOrphan", "en": "invalid entry = config references something that does not exist", "ru": null, "zh": "无效条目 = 配置里引用了不存在的东西", "source": "dshmarket"}
{"ns": "dsh-market", "key": "diagTermOrder", "en": "load order = the order plugins activate; the later one may override the earlier", "ru": null, "zh": "加载顺序 = 插件被激活的先后，后加载者可能覆盖先加载者", "source": "dshmarket"}
